    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37052" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pŏpŭlābundus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>laying waste</i>, <i>ravaging</i> (rare): agros
			populabundus, Sisenn. ap. <i><span class="en">Non. 471,
			23</span></i>; cf.<i><span class="en">Gell. 11, 15, 7</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in fines Romanos excurrerunt populabundi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					1, 15, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vagari populandum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					2, 60, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">consul per agrum populabundus ierat,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					3, 3, 10</span></i>
			.</div>
